+# Gaotus Mobility Driver v0.6.8+23 — GPS-First Map Startup
+
+- Removes London / server-state / job-pickup fallback from the Driver home map camera.
+- Primes OS last-known GPS as soon as the Driver home map is created, even while availability is offline.
+- Requests a fresh navigation-grade GPS fix immediately after cached GPS.
+- Does not construct the tile map until a real GPS position exists; first install shows a neutral locating state.
+- My Location now primes current GPS directly; existing online continuous GPS/realtime transport remains unchanged.
+- Notification, Firebase, push, realtime, dispatch and chat services are unchanged by this delta.
